## PR Title
fix *E,EXPRPA error reported by Cadence Xcelium simulator

## PR Description
The PR rewrites the offending construct in `tvip_axi_slave_default_sequence.svh` so that the compile-time embedded assignment that Xcelium rejects (`if ((delay = get_address_ready_delay(item)) >= 0)`) is replaced by a separate variable assignment followed by a plain comparison, eliminating the `EXPRPA` parse error. References issue #43.

